00:21:25.173 [transcriber] seg[277] KEEP      start=1380.20 end=1382.20 nsp=0.3349  text='Ибо мне это наш стабую секретик.'
00:21:25.174 [transcriber] seg[278] KEEP [?] start=1382.20 end=1383.20 nsp=0.3349 music=1 DISPUTE  text='Да, да.'
